    <task id="Id_1adc3438-d8ef-4d51-8709-7b05e4f15889" name="5.3.3 Avaliar a competência e capacidade da equipe tarefa">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Cada equipe de trabalho dever&amp;aacute; considerar:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. Compet&amp;ecirc;ncia e capacidade para gerenciar e produzir a infomra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Por exemplo: a estrat&amp;eacute;gia de fornecimento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es do plano de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do BIM identifica o uso de um pacote de software espec&amp;iacute;fico para gerenciar informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es. Os membros da equipe de trabalho t&amp;ecirc;m experi&amp;ecirc;ncia em gerenciar suas informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es usando esse software?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Por exemplo: os m&amp;eacute;todos e procedimentos de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es do projeto descrevem v&amp;aacute;rios m&amp;eacute;todos de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, incluindo conven&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de nomenclatura de espa&amp;ccedil;o, tipo de objeto e componente de objeto. Os membros da equipe de trabalho t&amp;ecirc;m experi&amp;ecirc;ncia em produzir suas informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es seguindo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;esses m&amp;eacute;todos?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2. Disponiblidade de tecnologia da inofmra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Por exemplo: o hardware, o software e a infraestrutura de TI dispon&amp;iacute;veis para a equipe de trabalho podem atender &amp;agrave; estrat&amp;eacute;gia de fornecimento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es? Caso contr&amp;aacute;rio, a equipe de trabalho precisaria descrever como pretende atender &amp;agrave; estrat&amp;eacute;gia de fornecimento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;Eacute; importante avaliar com precis&amp;atilde;o a capacidade e os recursos da equipe de trabalho e ser capaz de fornecer evid&amp;ecirc;ncias, se necess&amp;aacute;rio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_66066953-4376-4dd0-96b6-75ee53e66aa9</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_d31c32de-9cd8-47ab-a292-3f83b4082bc6</outgoing>
      <resourceRole id="Id_248919c6-e1e4-4304-a7be-9275859ad335">
        <q11:resourceRef xmlns="" xmlns:q11="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL">Subcontratadas</q11:resourceRef>
      </resourceRole>
      <resourceRole id="Id_17d0efad-bbf6-4980-afd0-0e9900ae3ac9">
        <q12:resourceRef xmlns="" xmlns:q12="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL">Empresas</q12:resourceRef>
      </resourceRole>
    </task>
    <task id="Id_374a261f-0b95-4000-9239-e839d11b0267" name="5.3.2 Elaborar o BEP Preliminar">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;O plano de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do BIM (pr&amp;eacute;-nomea&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o) &amp;eacute; estabelecido por uma poss&amp;iacute;vel licitante em nome da equipe de entrega e &amp;eacute; inclu&amp;iacute;do em sua resposta &amp;agrave; licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o. O fornecimento do plano de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do BIM (pr&amp;eacute;-nomea&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o) &amp;eacute; um requisito da ISO 19650-2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;A Cl&amp;aacute;usula 5.3.2 identifica sete &amp;aacute;reas que a poss&amp;iacute;vel licitante deve considerar ao estabelecer seu plano de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do BIM (pr&amp;eacute;-nomea&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o). No entanto, &amp;eacute; importante entender o que a contratante espera que o plano de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do BIM (pr&amp;eacute;-nomea&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o) contenha e cobrir isso adequadamente. Observe que a contratante pode ter seu pr&amp;oacute;prio modelo de plano de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do BIM, que deve estar em conformidade com a ISO 19650-2. Supondo que seja esse o caso, esse modelo deve ser disponibilizado como parte da documenta&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do convite &amp;agrave; licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;O plano de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do BIM (pr&amp;eacute;-indica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o) oferece uma oportunidade para que a poss&amp;iacute;vel licitante identifique acr&amp;eacute;scimos e/ou altera&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es nos m&amp;eacute;todos e procedimentos de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do projeto e em seu padr&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es. Isso pode ser necess&amp;aacute;rio para que:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; As informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es podem ser efetivamente geradas, revisadas, aprovadas, autorizadas e trocadas pelas diferentes partes envolvidas, e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; A distribui&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e o fornecimento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es s&amp;atilde;o seguros e eficazes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Resumo das atividades da cl&amp;aacute;usula:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Entenda os requisitos m&amp;iacute;nimos da contratante para o plano de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do BIM (pr&amp;eacute;-indica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o) e como ele ser&amp;aacute; avaliado&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Estabelecer se a contratante tem um modelo de plano de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o BIM que deve ser preenchido&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Verificar os m&amp;eacute;todos e procedimentos de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do projeto e seu padr&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es. Identifique as adi&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es ou altera&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es necess&amp;aacute;rias&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Considere os requisitos de conte&amp;uacute;do definidos na ISO 19650-2, cl&amp;aacute;usula 5.3.2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Colaborar com as poss&amp;iacute;veis partes designadas para que o conte&amp;uacute;do do plano de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do BIM (pr&amp;eacute;-indica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o) reflita razoavelmente o que a equipe de entrega far&amp;aacute;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Preencher o plano de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do BIM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
